{"seq":1,"slug":"react-hook-form","title":"React Hook Form 深度实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/libraries/react-hook-form","wordCount":1211,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"react-hook-form-深度实践\">React Hook Form 深度实践</h1><p>React Hook Form（RHF）以每周 1200 万次 npm 下载量稳居 React 表单库榜首。其核心洞见是将表单状态移出 React 渲染树——通过非受控组件 + ref 直接操作 DOM，在保持类型安全的同时实现接近零重渲染的性能。2026 年初发布的 v8 beta 进一步支持了 React Compiler 和扁平字段数组。本文从架构原理出发，覆盖 v7 稳定版的生产模式与 v8 的迁移要点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RHF 的核心洞见是<strong>把表单状态移出 React 渲染树</strong>：它维护一个独立于 React 的 Store（<code>_formValues</code> / <code>_formState</code>）与一套发布-订阅通道，输入事件由内部 listener 直接写入 Store，只有被组件订阅的 <code>formState</code> 切片变化时才触发重渲染。围绕这个 Store，<code>register</code> 负责用 ref 把原生元素接入（零重渲染），<code>Controller</code> 负责桥接不暴露 ref 的第三方组件（单字段局部受控），<code>useWatch</code> / <code>subscribe</code> 提供细粒度订阅，<code>useFieldArray</code> 管理动态列表。理解这条&quot;状态在 Store、订阅决定渲染范围&quot;的主线，就能推导出 RHF 的绝大多数性能优化模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"架构原理\">架构原理</h2><p>RHF 的内部状态管理不依赖 <code>useState</code>——它维护一个独立于 React 树的状态容器：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[useForm 实例] --&gt; B[内部 Store]&#10;    B --&gt; C[_formValues: Record]&#10;    B --&gt; D[_formState: errors/touched/dirty]&#10;    B --&gt; E[_subjects: 发布-订阅通道]&#10;    E --&gt; F[subscribe API]&#10;    E --&gt; G[formState proxy]&#10;    A --&gt; H[register → ref 注入 DOM]&#10;    A --&gt; I[handleSubmit → 从 Store 读值]\">graph TD\n    A[useForm 实例] --&gt; B[内部 Store]\n    B --&gt; C[_formValues: Record]\n    B --&gt; D[_formState: errors/touched/dirty]\n    B --&gt; E[_subjects: 发布-订阅通道]\n    E --&gt; F[subscribe API]\n    E --&gt; G[formState proxy]\n    A --&gt; H[register → ref 注入 DOM]\n    A --&gt; I[handleSubmit → 从 Store 读值]</pre><p>当用户输入时：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>DOM 原生 <code>input</code> 事件更新 DOM value</li>\n<li>RHF 的内部 listener 将新值写入 <code>_formValues</code>（非 React state）</li>\n<li>仅当 <code>formState</code> 中被组件订阅的部分发生变化时才触发重渲染</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这就是为什么一个 100 字段的表单在输入时依然流畅——React 根本不知道输入正在发生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"useform-配置全景\">useForm 配置全景</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const form = useForm&lt;FormValues&gt;({&#10;  defaultValues: { email: &#39;&#39;, password: &#39;&#39;, remember: false },&#10;  mode: &#39;onTouched&#39;,&#10;  reValidateMode: &#39;onChange&#39;,&#10;  resolver: zodResolver(schema),&#10;  shouldFocusError: true,&#10;  criteriaMode: &#39;firstError&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> form</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useForm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FormValues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  defaultValues: { email: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, password: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, remember: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'onTouched'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reValidateMode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'onChange'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolver: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zodResolver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(schema),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shouldFocusError: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  criteriaMode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'firstError'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>mode</code></td>\n<td>首次校验触发时机</td>\n<td><code>&#39;onTouched&#39;</code>——平衡反馈速度与干扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reValidateMode</code></td>\n<td>首次校验后的重校验时机</td>\n<td><code>&#39;onChange&#39;</code>——错误出现后实时更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resolver</code></td>\n<td>外部校验库集成（Zod/Yup）</td>\n<td>统一 schema 优先于内联 rules</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>shouldFocusError</code></td>\n<td>提交失败时聚焦首个错误字段</td>\n<td><code>true</code>——无障碍必需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>criteriaMode</code></td>\n<td>错误收集模式</td>\n<td><code>&#39;firstError&#39;</code>（除非需要同时展示所有错误）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>defaultValues</code></td>\n<td>必须提供——防止 uncontrolled→controlled 警告</td>\n<td>所有字段显式初始化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"register-与-controller-的取舍\">register 与 Controller 的取舍</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>用 register</th>\n<th>用 Controller</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原生 HTML input/select/textarea</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方组件不暴露 ref</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要值格式化/mask</td>\n<td>视情况</td>\n<td>通常是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件上传 input</td>\n<td>是（type=&quot;file&quot;）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义组件有 ref forwarding</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>register</code> 返回 <code>{ name, ref, onChange, onBlur }</code>——直接展开到原生元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"&lt;input {...register(&#39;email&#39;, {&#10;  required: &#39;邮箱必填&#39;,&#10;  pattern: { value: /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+$/, message: &#39;格式无效&#39; },&#10;})} /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'email'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  required: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'邮箱必填'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pattern: { value:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s@]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">@</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s@]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'格式无效'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Controller</code> 封装一个局部受控字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"&lt;Controller&#10;  name=&quot;category&quot;&#10;  control={control}&#10;  render={({ field, fieldState }) =&gt; (&#10;    &lt;Select&#10;      {...field}&#10;      options={categories}&#10;      error={fieldState.error?.message}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  )}&#10;/&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Controller</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  control</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{control}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  render</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{({ field, fieldState }) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;Select</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">field}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{categories}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{fieldState.error?.message}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"subscribe-api-v8-新增\">subscribe API（v8 新增）</h2><p>v8 移除了 <code>watch</code> 的回调形式，引入更明确的 <code>subscribe</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// v7（已废弃）&#10;watch((value, { name, type }) =&gt; console.log(value));&#10;&#10;// v8&#10;subscribe({ formValues: true }, ({ values }) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(values);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// v7（已废弃）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">watch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// v8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">subscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ formValues: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(values);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>subscribe</code> 支持细粒度订阅——只订阅 <code>formState</code> 的特定切片：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"subscribe({ name: &#39;email&#39; }, ({ values }) =&gt; {&#10;  // 仅 email 字段变化时触发&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">subscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'email'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 仅 email 字段变化时触发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"usefieldarray-动态列表\">useFieldArray：动态列表</h2><p>处理可增删的重复字段组（订单行项、联系人列表）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const { fields, append, remove, move, replace } = useFieldArray({&#10;  control,&#10;  name: &#39;contacts&#39;,&#10;})&#10;&#10;return (&#10;  &lt;&gt;&#10;    {fields.map((field, index) =&gt; (&#10;      &lt;div key={field.key}&gt; {/* v8: id → key */}&#10;        &lt;input {...register(`contacts.${index}.name`)} /&gt;&#10;        &lt;input {...register(`contacts.${index}.email`)} /&gt;&#10;        &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; onClick={() =&gt; remove(index)}&gt;删除&lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    ))}&#10;    &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; onClick={() =&gt; append({ name: &#39;&#39;, email: &#39;&#39; })}&gt;&#10;      添加联系人&#10;    &lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;/&gt;&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fields</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">remove</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">move</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useFieldArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  control,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'contacts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fields</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{field.key}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* v8: id → key */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(`</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">contacts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">$</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">`)} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(`</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">contacts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><s